# Purpose:
# Build, test, package, and deploy a Node.js backend
# application to an EC2 instance using PM2.
#
# Deployment Flow:
# 1. Checkout source code
# 2. Install dependencies
# 3. Run tests
# 4. Build application
# 5. Create deployment package
# 6. Upload package to EC2
# 7. Extract package and install production dependencies
# 8. Restart application using PM2